g is in August so anyone selling before that would be terrific.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Thanks,<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Joesie\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jajames83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.194.134.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417700906,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jjbrown","Id":281313,"Name":"jjbrown","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.216.192.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80194,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"298eeb22aba2450b8cdc2bab33e3245b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I purchased mine from Amazon thinking that I&#039;d sell it after my wedding but decided to keep it.&amp;nbsp; We just returned from our 1st anniversary trip and&amp;nbsp; I packed my dresses, a bathingsuit, cover up, heels, and accessories in my Wally Bag and used it as a carry on.&amp;nbsp; That bag is amazing!&amp;nbsp; Here is the link to the one I have if you can&#039;t find one from another bride. Good luck!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.amazon.com\/WallyBags-Inch-Tri-Fold-Destination-Black\/dp\/B002B0CR0S\/ref=sr_1_1?s=apparel&amp;amp;srs=2603461011&amp;amp;ie=UTF8&amp;amp;qid=1469460060&amp;amp;sr=8-1&amp;amp;keywords=destination&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.amazon.com\/WallyBags-Inch-Tri-Fold-Destination-Black\/dp\/B002B0CR0S\/ref=sr_1_1?s=apparel&amp;amp;srs=2603461011&amp;amp;ie=UTF8&amp;amp;qid=1469460060&amp;amp;sr=8-1&amp;amp;keywords=destination&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915024,"PostDate":1469445807,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I purchased mine from Amazon thinking that I'd sell it after my wedding but decided to keep it.\u00a0 We just returned from our 1st anniversary trip and\u00a0 I packed my dresses, a bathingsuit, cover up, heels, and accessories in my Wally Bag and used it as a carry on.\u00a0 That bag is amazing!\u00a0 Here is the link to the one I have if you can't find one from another bride. Good luck!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.amazon.com\/WallyBags-Inch-Tri-Fold-Destination-Black\/dp\/B002B0CR0S\/ref=sr_1_1?s=apparel&srs=2603461011&ie=UTF8&qid=1469460060&sr=8-1&keywords=destination' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.amazon.c...rds=destination<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candice.french@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.62.169.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415106695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280992.jpg?_r=1462713598","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissFrench","Id":280992,"Name":"MissFrench","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.7.145.170","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike"